# In SYN_SENT a SYN-ACK whose ACK does not acknowledge our SYN is answered
# with <SEQ=SEG.ACK><CTL=RST> and the connection stays in SYN_SENT
# (RFC 9293 3.10.7.3).
# Copyright (C) 2026 The LikeOS Project
0.000 socket c stream
0.000 connect c 8080 = -EINPROGRESS
0.000 > S 0:0(0) win * <mss 1460,sackOK,TS val * ecr 0,nop,wscale *>
0.050 < S. 0:0(0) ack 5000 win 65535 <mss 1460>
0.050 > R 5000:5000(0) win *
0.060 state c SYN_SENT
